To Be Continued

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:47.020
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:46.350 --> 00:23:49.200
Detective Terada was killed 
by Steel Lady Nanase.

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:52.730
At this rate, we might see even more victims.

00:23:52.730 --> 00:23:55.900
We have to defeat Steel Lady Nanase tonight.

00:23:56.530 --> 00:23:58.890
